2026-11-21 01:29+ - 10 cold-boot reliability test
------------------------------------------------------------------
Method: Linux `poweroff` (verified: red LED goes OFF, true rail cut) ->
        user presses power button -> measure SSH availability.
Note: U-Boot `poweroff` does NOT cut the rails (red LED stays on), so never
      use that for a cold boot.

#1  2026-11-21 01:28:05  SUCCESS  SSH up ~87s  systemd-analyze 1:19.7
   (kernel 55.8s + userspace 23.9s), single systemd-udevd, clean login.
   Preceded by: init-bottom settle reduced 180s -> 20s + initramfs rebuilt.
#2  2026-11-21 01:30:48  SUCCESS  SSH up ~74s  systemd-analyze 1:18.7  single udevd
